        "q": "Sec. 102-177. - Municipal park rate.",
        "a": "(a)\nMonthly user rate for the municipal park class is based upon the rate of $3.52 per\n               1,000 gallons.\n(b)\nThis service is interruptible to the extent the city may limit the times of irrigation\n               and the amount of water used. The city and the Apex Park and Recreation District-owned\n               properties, which have occupied structures located thereon, are excluded from this\n               class of water service.\n(Code 1981, § 33-92; Ord. No. 2574, § 1, 11-21-1988; Ord. No. 2671, § 29, 10-16-1989;\n               Ord. No. 2855, § 14, 10-21-1991; Ord. No. 2931, § 18, 10-19-1992; Ord. No. 3023, §\n               7, 11-15-1993; Ord. No. 3127, § 18, 10-24-1994; Ord. No. 3223, § 19, 10-23-1995; Ord.\n               No. 3297, § 12, 10-21-1996; Ord. No. 3403, § 24, 10-20-1997; Ord. No. 3490, § 2, 10-26-1998;\n               Ord. No. 3560, § 14, 10-11-1999; Ord. No. 3650, § 12, 10-23-2000; Ord. No. 3722, §\n               12, 10-8-2001; Ord. No. 3773, § 12, 10-21-2002; Ord. No. 3839, § 12, 10-13-2003; Ord.\n               No. 3920, § 12, 11-8-2004; Ord. No. 3969, § 12, 10-10-2005;\nOrd. No. 4027, § 12, 10-16-2006\n;\nOrd. No. 4099, § 12, 11-19-2007, eff. 1-1-2008\n;\nOrd. No. 4139, § 14, 11-17-2008, eff. 1-1-09\n;\nOrd. No. 4184, § 15, 10-19-2009, eff. 1-1-2010\n;\nOrd. No. 4233, § 8, 10-25-2010, eff. 1-1-2011\n;\nOrd. No. 4305, § 8, 11-14-2011, eff. 1-1-2012\n;\nOrd. No. 4359, § 8, 10-22-2012, eff. 1-1-2013\n;\nOrd. No. 4409, § 8, 10-21-2013, eff. 1-1-2014\n;\nOrd. No. 4464, § 8, 10-20-2014, eff. 1-1-2015\n;\nOrd. No. 4523, § 8, 10-19-2015, eff. 1-1-2016\n; Ord. No. 4569, § 8, eff. 1-1-2017; Ord. No.\n4609\n, § 8, eff. 1-1-2018;\nOrd. No. 4657\n, § 8, eff. 1-1-2019; Ord. No.\n4709\n, § 8, 10-21-2019; Ord. No.\n4746\n, § 8, 11-2-2020; Ord. No.\n4784\n, § 8, 11-15-2021;\nOrd. No. 4817\n, § 8, 10-17-2022, eff. 1-1-2023;\nOrd. No. 4858\n, § 8, 10-16-2023;\nOrd. No. 4879\n, § 8, 10-21-2024)"
